ined Jujutsu to me. It’s long, but it’s mostly commands and terminal output. You’ll be fine. English isn’t my native language. If you want to help, PRs are welcome! CC BY-SA 4.0 - https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.en ↩","fetched_at":"2026-09-24T10:32:23.870Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<h2>Keyboard shortcuts</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Keyboard shortcuts","zh":"键盘快捷键"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Press <kbd>←</kbd> or <kbd>→</kbd> to navigate between chapters</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Press ← or → to navigate between chapters","zh":"按 ← 或 → 在章节之间导航"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Press <kbd>S</kbd> or <kbd>/</kbd> to search in the book</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Press S or / to search in the book","zh":"按 S 或 / 在书中搜索"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Press <kbd>?</kbd> to show this help</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Press ?","zh":"按 ？"},{"en":"to show this help","zh":"显示此帮助"}]},{"html_en":"<p>Press <kbd>Esc</kbd> to hide this help</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Press Esc to hide this help","zh":"按 Esc 键隐藏此帮助"}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"in-praise-of-human-beings\"><a href=\"#in-praise-of-human-beings\">In praise of human beings</a></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"In praise of human beings","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>This book was written by a human (hello, I’m\n<a href=\"https://arialdomartini.github.io\">Arialdo</a>), not AI, because I\nrespect your intelligence.<br>It is available in <a href=\"https://arialdo.codeberg.page/ju-ju-tsu/\">HTML</a>\nand <a href=\"https://arialdo.codeberg.page/ju-ju-tsu/pdf\">PDF</a>.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"This book was written by a human (hello, I’m Arialdo), not AI, because I respect your intelligence.It is available in HTML and PDF.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>It aims to be:</p>","sentences":[{"en":"It aims to be:","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li>Lean: because your time is precious.</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Lean: because your time is precious.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li>Practical: because less talk, more action is 👌</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Practical: because less talk, more action is 👌","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li>Incremental: because you want to start using <code>jj</code> from day 0.</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Incremental: because you want to start using jj from day 0.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li>No hand-holding: because discovering is more fun than being told.</li>","sentences":[{"en":"No hand-holding: because discovering is more fun than being told.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li>Unorthodox: because Jujutsu is extravagant, and ordinary tutorials\nare boring.</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Unorthodox: because Jujutsu is extravagant, and ordinary tutorials are boring.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>It’s free<sup id=\"fr-1-1\"><a href=\"#footnote-1\">1</a></sup> (as in beer) because I’m merely giving back what I was\ngiven. And because I love beer.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"It’s free1 (as in beer) because I’m merely giving back what I was given.","zh":null},{"en":"And because I love beer.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>If you’d like to pay for it, please donate to a charity of your\nchoice.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"If you’d like to pay for it, please donate to a charity of your choice.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>I’m no authority, just a fellow student. I wrote this the way I wish\nsomeone had explained Jujutsu to me.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"I’m no authority, just a fellow student.","zh":null},{"en":"I wrote this the way I wish someone had explained Jujutsu to me.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>It’s long, but it’s mostly commands and terminal output. You’ll be\nfine.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"It’s long, but it’s mostly commands and terminal output.","zh":null},{"en":"You’ll be fine.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>English isn’t my native language. If you want to help,\n<a href=\"https://codeberg.org/arialdo/ju-ju-tsu\">PRs</a> are welcome!</p>","sentences":[{"en":"English isn’t my native language.","zh":null},{"en":"If you want to help, PRs are welcome!","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li id=\"footnote-1\">\n<p>CC BY-SA 4.0 - https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.en <a href=\"#fr-1-1\">↩</a></p>\n</li>","sentences":[{"en":"CC BY-SA 4.0 - https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.en ↩","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>CC BY-SA 4.0 - https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.en <a href=\"#fr-1-1\">↩</a></p>","sentences":[{"en":"CC BY-SA 4.0 - https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.en ↩","zh":null}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\">\n    <div id=\"mdbook-help-container\">\n            <h2>键盘快捷键</h2>\n            <div>\n                <p>按 ← 或 → 在章节之间导航</p>\n                <p>按 S 或 / 在书中搜索</p>\n                <p>按 ？ 显示此帮助</p>\n                <p>按 Esc 键隐藏此帮助</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    <div id=\"mdbook-body-container\">\n        <!-- Work around some values being stored in localStorage wrapped in quotes -->\n        \n\n        <!-- Set the theme before any content is loaded, prevents flash -->\n        \n\n        \n\n        <!-- Hide / unhide sidebar before it is displayed -->\n        \n\n        <nav id=\"mdbook-sidebar\" aria-label=\"Table of contents\">\n            <!-- populated by js -->\n            <mdbook-sidebar-scrollbox></mdbook-sidebar-scrollbox>\n            \n            \n        </nav>\n\n        <div id=\"mdbook-page-wrapper\">\n\n            <div class=\"page\" id=\"mdbook-content\">\n                    <main>\n                        <h2 id=\"in-praise-of-human-beings\">In praise of human beings</h2>\n<p>This book was written by a human (hello, I’m Arialdo), not AI, because I respect your intelligence.It is available in HTML and PDF.</p>\n<p>It aims to be:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lean: because your time is precious.</li>\n<li>Practical: because less talk, more action is 👌</li>\n<li>Incremental: because you want to start using jj from day 0.</li>\n<li>No hand-holding: because discovering is more fun than being told.</li>\n<li>Unorthodox: because Jujutsu is extravagant, and ordinary tutorials are boring.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>It’s free1 (as in beer) because I’m merely giving back what I was given. And because I love beer.</p>\n<p>If you’d like to pay for it, please donate to a charity of your choice.</p>\n<p>I’m no authority, just a fellow student. I wrote this the way I wish someone had explained Jujutsu to me.</p>\n<p>It’s long, but it’s mostly commands and terminal output. You’ll be fine.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>English isn’t my native language. If you want to help, PRs are welcome!</p>\n<hr>\n<ol>\n<li id=\"footnote-1\">CC BY-SA 4.0 - https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/deed.en ↩</li>\n</ol>\n\n                    </main>\n\n                    <nav aria-label=\"Page navigation\">\n                        <!-- Mobile navigation buttons -->\n\n                            <a rel=\"next prefetch\" href=\"preface/whats-about.html\" title=\"Next chapter\" aria-label=\"Next chapter\" aria-keyshortcuts=\"Right\">\n                                <span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Free 6.2.0 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) Copyright 2022 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z\" /></svg></span>\n                            </a>\n\n                        \n                    </nav>\n                </div>\n\n            <nav aria-label=\"Page navigation\">\n\n                    <a rel=\"next prefetch\" href=\"preface/whats-about.html\" title=\"Next chapter\" aria-label=\"Next chapter\" aria-keyshortcuts=\"Right\">\n                        <span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Free 6.2.0 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (